  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>After an MA, MSc, MCom or MSW you can work in your field, teach, enter research, take government or other exams, or move into a related role with added skills, and since eligibility and pay vary, list roles from real notices, compare them and build a small project that proves the skill the role needs.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
